What Comprises the Winter Sports Equipment Market?
Winter sports equipment comprises specialized gear engineered for cold-weather athletic activities, including skis, snowboards, ice skates, sleds, and protective apparel. The market has evolved beyond traditional equipment to incorporate smart wearable technologies like GPS-enabled goggles and biomechanical sensors that enhance performance monitoring and safety.

